  {
   "id": "apsulov-end-of-gods-111130@1.1.4",
   "gameId": "apsulov-end-of-gods-111130",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.4",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2019-09-02T14:38:58.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A major patch was just made available to everyone that will fix issues we've discovered and that has reported through steam discussions, mail and on our discord.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Version 1.1.4 contains",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A later version of unreal engine that fixes crashes, errors and some compatability issues that were outside our control.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cosmetic fixes, and improvements to the graphics in several parts of the game (Shaders, light, animations and more)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Main menu now has an animated background",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Collision fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Custom menu font for russian localization",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corrections to Swedish, English and russian subtitles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A \"The Sight Effect\" option in graphics menu adding the option to turn off \"the sight\" overlay effect that can be straining on the eyes in some cases",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated the \"Unlock-system\" that mostly only unlocked seer unlockables. (When patch download is complete, if you start the game you should recieve the content you originally unlocked)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed AI issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated credits to contain some names that was left out (Sorry everyone)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed option for turning off \"logg autoplay\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spirits can no longer spawn inside rocks in the final battle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And several other fixes that will fix different rare issues with crashing and other errors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regards // Angry Demon Studio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
